{
  "changelog": "- Initial release of the \"\u5426\u51b3/\u5e9f\u6807\u51b3\u7b56\u652f\u6301\u00b7\u4e13\u5bb6\u7248\" (Bid Rejection Decision Support, Expert Version) skill.\n- Provides structured decision support for bid rejection/clarification questions, triggered only when both a specific bidder's response and the corresponding tender clause are provided.\n- Delivers clear outcomes: (1) rejection determination with legal/clause basis; (2) distinction between mandatory rejection and clarifiable deficiencies; (3) standardized wording for evaluation reports.\n- Ensures accurate, well-founded, and defensible judgments, with built-in safeguards to stay within disciplinary and legal boundaries.\n- Distinct from scanning, risk radar, or general Q&A\u2014focused specifically on expert committee-side decision-making support.",
